  {
    "hotel_id": "4125675",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hilton-garden-inn-kuala-lumpur-tuanku-abdul-rahman-north/hotel/kuala-lumpur-my.html",
    "name": "Hilton Garden Inn Kuala Lumpur Jalan Tuanku Abdul Rahman North",
    "detail": "Hilton Garden Inn Kuala Lumpur offered us convenient stay relatively close to the city center. Our first room on 6th floor could've been taken better care by room cleaner the room was handed to us – we didn't find this an issue though as we requested a room change after couple of nights due to very loud families on the same floor, next to our rooms. The staff handled this situation with total respect and very professionally – we got a new room the next day from the 8th floor. Little bit bigger, therefore better for us and it was completely clean as well. Great service! The South tower has very lovely rooftop bar with relatively high prices (partially even higher than on rooftop bar in Marini's on 57 – luxury bar with dress code and very valuable location) but more than acceptable pool facilities that we enjoyed of quite a few times. The breakfast served downstairs in the North tower was very unimpressive with lot of deep fried foods lacking the fresh options. ",
